</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="507564">სავიზიტო ბარათი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12040_294405_507579"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In 2-D stacked bar and column charts, a line that connects the data markers in a data series and is used to emphasize the difference in measurement between each series.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="294405">series line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="507579">მწკრივთა ზოლი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1205_397999_1770561"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contract that restricts disclosure of confidential information or proprietary knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397999">NDA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1770561">NDA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1205_85315_1770561"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contract that restricts disclosure of confiden