 same direction, parallel to each other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766600">panning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1224133">პანირება</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21093_766602_1224134"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A multi-touch gesture that consists of two fingers moving in opposite directions (-&gt; &lt;- or &lt;- -&gt;).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766602">zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1224134">მასშტაბირება</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21093_766602_2530820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A multi-touch gesture that consists of two fingers moving in opposite directions (-&gt; &lt;- or &lt;- -&gt;).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766602">zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2530820">ზომა;მასშტაბი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig><