ments made in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623959">Comments pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1889464">კომენტარების პანელი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31790_1623960_1889465"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A crawl that operates on a continuous basis to scan and index new and modified content from a source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623960">continuous crawl</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1889465">მუდმივი სკანირება</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31793_1623963_1889466"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An instance of Excel that has minimal UI and that enables a user to insert or edit chart data within the context of a non-Excel Office document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623963">Data Grid</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1889466">მონაცემთა ბადე</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="gramm