e periods, such as days of the week or months, over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1626605">cycle chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1883902">ციკლური დიაგრამა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31895_1626606_1889495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A high performance analytics engine that uses compressed in-memory column-oriented storage to manage large volumes of data and deliver fast response to user queries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1626606">Vertipaq</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1889495">Vertipaq</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31896_1626607_1889496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Project Server logging infrastructure that improves efficiency by enabling admins to customize logging levels for project entities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1626607">Log Level Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1889496">ჟურნალის დონის მმართველი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote