O</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34373_1991483_2916597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The console disc tray eject button.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991483">eject button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916597">გამოდევნის ღილაკი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34374_1991484_2916598"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Ethernet port on the back of the console.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991484">Ethernet port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916598">ეთერნეტის პორტი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34375_1991485_2916639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the console where the hard drive is attached.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991485">hard drive bay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916639">მყარი დისკის განყოფილება</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34376_1991486_2916640"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cover that protects the hard drive bay in the absence of an attached hard drive.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991486">hard drive bay cover</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916640">მყარი დისკის განყოფილების თავსახური</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34377_1991487_2916641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The plug that connects the hard drive to the console.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991487">hard drive connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916641">მყარი დისკის დამაკავშირებელი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34378_1991488_2916642"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The HDMI port on the back of the Xbox 360 console.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1991488">HDMI AV port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termN