 marker that can be associated with content or items, such as photos or text, to identify certain types of information, and that allows users to find, view, and sort marked content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359686">tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="508003">შენიშვნის ტეგი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3711_359686_508004"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A marker that can be associated with content or items, such as photos or text, to identify certain types of information, and that allows users to find, view, and sort marked content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359686">tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="508004">ტეგი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3712_1814226_2064992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A telephone conversation between three or more people.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814226">conference</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2064992">საკონფერენციო ზარი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3712_418619_2064992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A telephone conversation between three or more people.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418619">conference call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2064992">საკონფერენციო ზარი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37135_2781058_2783420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for government organizations for OneDrive for Business that includes Office Online, and that is hosted in the commercial cloud environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781058">OneDrive for Business with Office on the web (Government Pricing)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2783420">OneDrive for Business და Office ინტერნეტით (სამთავრობო ტარიფი)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37147_2108981_2111147"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's portal site, offering news,  sports, weather, finance, autos, food &amp; drink, health &amp; fitness, autos, travel, weather,   m