ection of add-ins that transform pages from a variety of apps into sways.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329599">Send to Sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340083">Sway-ში გაგზავნა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40093_2329763_2340081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The blog platform on Docs.com where users can share their posts using Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329763">Journal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340081">Журнал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40107_2330211_2340079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint authoring tool that allows users to create different types of SharePoint pages such as microsites, articles, and blogs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330211">authoring canvas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340079">საავტორო ფონი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected<