otential vulnerabilities affecting your organization’s identities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113359">Microsoft Entra ID Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113858">Microsoft Entra ID-ის დაცვა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40474_2350857_3025137"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A servicing release cadence to receive development builds. Each ring is defined by a different release frequency and level of stability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350857">ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3025137">წრე</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40475_2350858_2870410"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office servicing option in which new feature upgrades are available for installation right after they were first published by Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2350858">Current Branch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2870410">მიმდინარე არხი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNo