ed in HTML format and can contain audio and video. It can also be recorded and saved to be viewed later.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146682">presentation broadcast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1888978">პრეზენტაციის მაუწყებლობა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45253_2555759_2916907"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unit of measurement used in traditional tabletop role-playing games and role-playing video games to quantify a player character's progression through the game. Experience points are awarded for the completion of quests, overcoming obstacles and opponents, and for successful role-playing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555759">XP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916907">XP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45256_2555925_2916882"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category in the Settings app where developers can configure their Xbox Live accounts in order to take advantage of the Xbox Live features and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555925">Xbox Networking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916882">Xbox-ის ქსელი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45269_2556878_2558986"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A handle that allows users to scroll by touching the device's screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556878">scroll handle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2558986">ცოციას ჩასაჭიდი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45282_2556931_2558984"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ink effect in the colors of a rainbow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556931">rainbow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2558984">ცისარტყელა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45283_2556932_2558981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect applied to digital ink.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556932">ink effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumb