 requires validation is selected and that gives instructions to the people using the spreadsheet on valid input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652497">input message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2653616">ინფორმაციის შეყვანის შეტყობინება</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47078_2652498_2653617"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software system that determines the likelihood of incoming emails being a phishing attempt due to analysis of previous emailing history.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652498">mailbox intelligence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2653617">ჭკვიანი ფოსტა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47092_2652805_3016729"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that tells users when their contacts were last logged in to the application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652805">Last seen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3016729">ბოლო ნახვა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNou