re that allows users to create and assign tasks at the individual and team level and that allows end users to review completed tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681125">Tasks</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2951658">Tasks</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47642_2911840_2912548"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams mode that allows admins to configure and enable the features and functionality targeted at frontline workers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2911840">frontline worker configuration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2912548">პირველი რიგის თანამშრომლის კონფიგურაცია</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47643_2681127_2681810"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook button that opens a Help pane that explains how users can enable preview features.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681127">Coming Soon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681810">მალე გამოვა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="