 where further action is needed to address a compliance-related issue for an employee. Each case is scoped to a single employee and multiple alerts for the employee can be added to an existing case or to a new case.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844764">case</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2848313">მონაწილის რისკის მართვის შემთხვევა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50334_2844764_2849928"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A record that is manually created from insider risk alerts in the situations where further action is needed to address a compliance-related issue for an employee. Each case is scoped to a single employee and multiple alerts for the employee can be added to an existing case or to a new case.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844764">case</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849928">მონაწილის რისკის შემთხვევა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50335_2844769_2849944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In insider risk management, a template that allows administrators to automatically send email messages to employees when their activities generate a policy match and alert.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844769">notice template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849944">შეტყობინების შაბლონი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50336_2844806_2846981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A validation of a partner’s capability to deliver high-fidelity services in a specific solution area. Advanced specializations are customer-facing labels displayed on a partner’s business profile in the Partner Directory, enabling partners to showcase their differentiated skills.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844806">advanced specialization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2846981">გაუმჯობესებული სპეციალიზაცია</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50337_2844818_2848317"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A validation of a partner’s broad technical capability in a Microsoft product or technology.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844818">competency</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2848317">კომპეტენცია</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50338_2844833_2846962"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An advanced specialization that provides a means for partners to showcase proven expertise and verifiable accreditation in adoption and change management services via Microsoft 365 Teams and Yammer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844833">Adoption and change management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2846962">ათვისებისა და ცვლილების მენეჯმენტი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50339_2844838_2849935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An advanced specialization that provides a means for partners to showcase proven, verifiable expertise in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844838">Meetings and meeting rooms for Microsoft Teams</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849935">შეხვედრები და შეხვედრის ოთახები Microsoft-ის გუნდებისთვის</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50340_2844846_2849951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An advanced specialization that allows partners to showcase proven expertise and Microsof