orkday to reflect, celebrate accomplishments, plan the next day's tasks, or meditate with Headspace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2946739">virtual commute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947360">ვირტუალური მგზავრობის დრო</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52143_2947723_2948372"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML document that specifies a list of sites, their compatibility mode, and their intended browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947723">Enterprise Mode Site List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2948372">ორგანიზაციის რეჟიმში საიტების სია</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52144_2947724_2948375"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A benefit, advantage, or discount provided to a customer when they use a product in association with a Windows device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947724">Windows benefit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2948375">Windows-ით მიღებული სარგებელი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="