e presenter is displayed in another rectangle to the right.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3017115">Side-by-side</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3018655">გვერდიგვერდ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53056_3017116_3018649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The universal interactive canvas application that moves freely across applications, bringing human connection back into hybrid work to enable teams to think, plan, and create together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3017116">Loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3018649">Loop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53056_3017116_3023495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The universal interactive canvas application that moves freely across applications, bringing human connection back into hybrid work to enable teams to think, plan, and create together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3017116">Loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023495">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53056_3022592_3018649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The universal interactive canvas application that moves freely across applications, bringing human connection back into hybrid work to enable teams to think, plan, and create together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022592">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3018649">Loop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53056_3022592_3023495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The universal interactive canvas application that moves freely across applications, bringing human connection back into hybrid work to enable teams to think, plan, and create together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022592">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023495">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53057_3017117_3018652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Loop element that lets the user see, group,