sed by Excel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080962">serial_number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083185">სერიული_რიცხვი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54062_3083270_3083977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Clock app which helps users minimize distractions by turning on Do Not Disturb and silencing icon flashing and badge notifications for apps in the taskbar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083270">focus session</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083977">ფოკუსირების პერიოდი</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54063_3083390_3084774"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Defender for Business add-on that delivers the same level of protection for both clients and servers within a single admin experience, helping users to protect all endpoints in one location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083390">Microsoft Defender for Business servers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3084774">Microsoft Defender ბიზნესის სერვერე