ins to customize Together Mode scenes for licensed users in an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100238">organization together mode scene</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100735">ორგანიზაციის ერთად შეკრების რეჟიმის სცენა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54580_3100695_3101103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The retail media advertising platform that connects brands with the world's largest retailers and their active shoppers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100695">PromoteIQ</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101103">PromoteIQ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54581_3100752_3101100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that integrates the most common PC/desktop management functions: virus inspection, trash cleaning, system repair/upgrade, system optimization, application management, pop-up blocking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100752">PC Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101100">პერსონალური კომპიუტერის მმართვ