 in Clipchamp that replicates your voice to personalize your audio and video recording.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3177428">personal voice</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3178736">პირადი ხმა</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56502_3177431_3177890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A holistic security service that provides advanced detection and response capabilities using a combination of digital technologies and outsourced human-led expertise.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3177431">managed extended detection and response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3177890">მართვადი გაფართოებული გამოვლენა და რეაგირება</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GEO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56502_3177431_3177892"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A holistic security service that provides advanced detection and response capabilities using a combination of digital technologies and outsourced human-led expertise.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3177431">managed extended detection and response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ka"><ntig